Atari TOS 1.62
--------------

This project ships no Atari ROM, no part of one, and no image derived from one.

An Atari TOS 1.62 image is proprietary software owned by Atari Interactive, Inc. / Atari SA. It can
only be supplied by the user, from a machine or medium they own. The project holds no licence to
distribute it and does not: the emulator validates a user-supplied image against a pinned SHA-256
accept-list (`roms/tos-hashes.json`) and refuses anything else.

See docs/adr/0010-tos-image-provisioning.md.


